{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"vaarstandersenpau","last":"Vaarst Andersen","name":"Vaarst Andersen, Kristina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Præst","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"efc4aa3e-11bb-4546-b241-8ce6dd970891","name":"Knudsen, Mette Præst","orcid":"0000-0002-2055-5308","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nanna","key":"meilbakpau","last":"Meilbak","name":"Meilbak, Nanna","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Continuous Innovation Network","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the 25th CINet Conference","title":"Organizing for Collaborative Innovation"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-04e937a1-a6b5-45b5-a3af-0f9c021bae3b"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Implementation of 3D Print Technology in Manufacturing Firms","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801582","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"ERHVERVSØKONOMI er en omfattende introduktion til erhvervsøkonomi, designet til bachelorstuderende på videregående uddannelser. Bogen dækker de væsentligste teorier og modeller, og giver en dybdegående forståelse af virksomheders økonomiske strukturer og beslutningsprocesser. Den gennemgår: ••Virksomhedens strategiske univers: Lær at navigere i komplekse markeder og anvend strategiske modeller til at analysere virksomhedens relationer til omverdenen. ••Velfærdsteori: Forstå grundlæggende mikroøkonomiske principper, herunder efficiens og Pareto-optimalitet. •Produktionsteori og Omkostningsteori: Udforsk produktionsfunktioner og omkostningsstrukturer for optimal ressourceanvendelse. •Afsætningsteori og Pris/Mængde Optimering: Opnå indsigt i prismodeller og metoder til at finde balancen mellem pris og produktion. •Spilteori: Analyser strategiske interaktioner mellem virksomheder og løs konfliktsituationer optimalt. •Virksomhedens Regnskab og Økonomistyring: Få kendskab til regnskabsprincipper og teknikker til økonomistyring for økonomisk bæredygtighed. ERHVERVSØKONOMI kombinerer teoretiske rammer med praktiske eksempler og casestudier, der udvikler læserens evner til kritisk analyse og informeret beslutningstagning. Bogens forfattere er undervisere med lang erfaring inden for økonomi,  erhvervsliv, tekniske uddannelser og forskning.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Hedegaard, Michael","Lund, Victor","Kjærsgaard, Niels Christian","Eriksen, Lynn","Andersen, Kristina Vaarst","Andersson, John Eli","Hedegaard, Ove","Lauritsen, Helle"],"cuid":["S02-086.94-768078"],"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"edu","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"erhvervsøkonomi","src":["cbs","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://djoefforlag.dk/products/erhvervsokonomi","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-086.94-768078","ids":["cbs-883eba05-7093-4bc3-9659-553b6a7f1499","dtu-c38f0f1a-0568-44d4-99e9-376ae5321bb4"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-5B0E31509A945817C7D819FC5AABC265"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Engineering Technology and Didactics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Engineering Technology and Didactics, Business Development"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Society and Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael","key":"hedegaardmichaelpau","last":"Hedegaard","locid":"c45d8476-3a34-47cc-8f7c-0a56ccb2bd55","name":"Hedegaard, Michael","orcid":"0000-0001-6771-5893","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Victor","key":"lundvictorpau","last":"Lund","locid":"cc6876e5-1491-47f2-8b02-72bbd5a6293f","name":"Lund, Victor","orcid":"0000-0002-0424-4729","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"kjærsgaardnielschristianpau","last":"Kjærsgaard","locid":"2aa4674