{"abstract":"Den foreslåede beskæring af kandidatuddannelserne vil medføre en markant reduktion af uddannelseskvaliteten, øget stress og mistrivsel blandt studerende samt forringede muligheder for studerende for at have studiejob og praktikforløb, som ellers ofte giver dem en fod indenfor på arbejdsmarkedet.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Kropp, Kristoffer","Vallgårda, Karen","Laustsen-Kiel, Andreas Hougaardl","Albrechtsen, Nicolai","Sylow, Lykke","Busk Damgaard, Rune","Kristensen, Line Burholt","Hansen, Niels Christian","Uusimäki, Elisa","Jønsson, Alexandra Brandt Ryborg","Høyland-Kroghsbo, Nina Molin","Eriksen, Janus Juul","Ebert Andersen, Peter","Kruse Jensen, Louise","Lomborg, Stine","Morueta-Holme, Naia","Bakkær Simonsen, Kristina","Zetterberg-Nielsen, Simona","Autzen, Anton"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-749921"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["Det unge akademi"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"universiteterne har brug for en reformpause","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/kommentatorer/universiteterne-har-brug-for-en-reformpause","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-749921","ids":["ruc-3d8d86e5-956d-4e1d-b5ea-88076fec8f36"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-039F66EC27D6138B6116C71E20AB9E55"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of So