{"abstract":"Podcast om forløbet - Med Lyden Som Redskab, der undersøger og afprøver specialdesignet musik og lyddesign som stressnedsættende og stemningsforbedrende redskaber før, under og efter fødsler på Regionshospitalet Gødstrup.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Folmann, Birgitte","Wulff, Kåre","Andersen, Kristina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-653225"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Æstetik design og medier"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCS"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kan lyd være et redskab om afprøvning af lyddesign til brug i sundhedsvæsenet","src":["ucsyd"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCS"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://soundcloud.com/jordemoder/med-lyden-som-redskab/s-5sKyGapMUNf?si=c005435fcf1f4fa4a63af87d35ba9cfa&utm_source=clipboard&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=social_sharing","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-653225","ids":["ucsyd-348b0b54-a788-49bd-b0bf-bf1e4c1c55fc"],"keyword":["Æstetik, design og medier"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-15223535A799C576840AA7B64A092750"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://soundcloud.com/jordemoder/med-lyden-som-redskab/s-5sKyGapMUNf?si=c005435fcf1f4fa4a63af87d35ba9cfa&utm_source=clipboard&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=social_sharing","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"uc syd university college south denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCS","l3nl":"UC SYD, University College South Denmark","l3nn":"UC SYD University College South Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UC SYD University College South Denmark","namevar":["UC SYD, Samfund og sundhed, Lyddesigneruddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Birgitte","key":"folmannpau","last":"Folmann","locid":"bd5fe360-da84-48c3-b00b-85e8b78233a6","name":"Folmann, Birgitte","orcid":"0000-0003-0814-9443","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kåre","key":"wulffpau","last":"Wulff","name":"Wulff, Kåre","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Kristina","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UC SYD, University College South Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucsyd-348b0b54-a788-49bd-b0bf-bf1e4c1c55fc"],"src":["UC SYD University College South Denmark"],"title":"Kan lyd være et redskab? : om afprøvning af lyddesign til brug i sundhedsvæsenet","type":"Non-Textual Item","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-653225","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The aims of this systematic review were to identify the prevalence of hypoglycemia among pregnant women treated with gastric bypass, and risk factors of hypoglycemic events in pregnancy. We searched MEDLINE, EMBASE, Cochrane, and Scopus databases from inception to April 6, 2021. Six studies investigating glucose metabolism in pregnancy following gastric bypass were included (n = 330). As assessed by the oral glucose tolerance test and continuous glucose monitoring, 57.6% (95% CI [40.1, 75.1]) of women with gastric bypass were exposed to hypoglycemia during pregnancy. No studies performed the mixed meal test, and no studies reported on risk factors associated with hypoglycemia. Further studies are required to determine the magnitude of hypoglycemia in these women’s everyday-life using continuous glucose monitoring and mixed meal test. Graphic Abstract: [Figure not available: see fulltext.]","author_count":9,"contributors":["Stentebjerg, Louise L.","Madsen, Lene R.","Støving, René K.","Juhl, Claus B.","Vinter, Christina A.","Andersen, Lise Lotte T.","Renault, Kristina","Jensen, Dorte M."],"cuid":["S03-095.63-022026"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Stentebjerg, Louise L.","Stentebjerg, Louise Laage"],"keyword":["Association","Bariatric surgery","Blood Glucose Self Monitoring","Blood Glucose metabolism","Continuous glucose monitoring","Diagnosis","Female","Gastric Bypass adverse effects","Glucose Tolerance Test","Humans","Hypoglycemia","Hypoglycemia complications","Meta analysis","Mixed meal test","Obesity","Obesity Morbid surgery","Oral glucose tolerance test","Pregnancy","Profiles","Roux en Y gastric bypass","Systematic review","Women"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hypoglycemia in pregnancies following gastric bypass a systematic review and meta analysis","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11695-022-06021-z","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-095.63-022026","identifier":[{"id":"000772727800003","type":"wos"},{"id":"85127616921","type":"scopus"},{"id":"35332397","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-804a8b16-6431-4133-bc6b-ccbfa9ab6629","ku-71dd7d84-5d41-429c-ae74-0947083a5d57","sdu-115ca9c4-2cec-464b-a00d-f512d96d093c"],"keyword":["ASSOCIATION","Bariatric surgery","Blood Glucose Self-Monitoring","Blood Glucose/metabolism","Continuous glucose monitoring","DIAGNOSIS","Female","GLUCOSE-TOLERANCE TEST","Gastric Bypass/adverse effects","Humans","Hypoglycemia","Hypoglycemia/complications","Meta-analysis","Mixed meal test","Obesity","Obesity, Morbid/surgery","Oral glucose tolerance test","POSTPRANDIAL HYPERINSULINEMIC HYPOGLYCEMIA","PROFILES","Pregnancy","Roux-en-Y gastric bypass","Systematic review","WOMEN"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-5850B0425424DEB15B5581EB019583BE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/202223757/Hypoglycemia_in_pregnancy_main_text.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11695-022-06021-z","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/358650683/Fulltext_2_26.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl"