 Clinical Medicine - Department of Infectious Diseases","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Department of Health Services Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Christine","key":"nordholmpau","last":"Nordholm","name":"Nordholm, Anne Christine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Pernille","key":"ravnpau","last":"Ravn","locid":"3f19690c-0d72-4d09-a542-a309efd6fb0a","name":"Ravn, Pernille","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristina Langholz","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","name":"Kristensen, Kristina Langholz","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Ulrikka","key":"nygaardpau","last":"Nygaard","locid":"43b2e239-ddc1-4676-a8db-0a0f23906813","name":"Nygaard, Ulrikka","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Sidse Graff","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Sidse Graff","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"wejsepau","last":"Wejse","locid":"382d58c8-3a9b-48f2-a419-ad70bdeaa4e3","name":"Wejse, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-2534-2942","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Åse Bengård","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Åse Bengård","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Troels","key":"lillebækpau","last":"Lillebæk","locid":"4c4e219b-6ac0-4067-a078-ef52b9c2beff","name":"Lillebaek, Troels","name_org":"Lillebæk, Troels","orcid":"0000-0002-2601-2718","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31791459"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"16","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","paperid":"V09190494","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Lægeforening","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"181"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85126971997"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-1b19729b-779f-47b1-8a57-3e59991272d8","au-76ccb7bf-79fe-4dd6-82e4-389d8dcd7b4f","ku-c3502706-e541-4b1c-89ad-4ecf422bd620"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Vi skal blive bedre til at teste for latent tuberkulose i Danmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-088.73-014562","year":"2019","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"AIMS AND OBJECTIVES: To explore the experiences and needs of relatives being part of the endovascular therapy (EVT) pathway. BACKGROUND: Ischaemic stroke is the third leading cause of death and the most common cause of acquired disability among adults in the Western world. The most recently approved treatment for major stroke is EVT. Removing the arterial occlusion has proven to be the best predictor of outcome. While patients are treated, relatives are left waiting. Facing the massive shock of their loved ones having a stroke may cause emotional turmoil and leave relatives with various needs. No previous studies have explored experiences and needs of relatives who are part of an EVT pathway. DESIGN: A qualitative design using a phenomenological-hermeneutic approach. METHODS: Semi-structured interviews and participant observations were carried out. Data were collected from April 2016-January 2017. Data were analysed using Ricoeur's theory of interpretation, capturing meaning and ensuring comprehensive understanding. RESULTS: Four themes emerged are as follows: (a) The first phase-shock, chaos and feeling paralysed; (b) the all-important information-sharing is pivotal; (c) professional loving care-being seen and heard by caring health professionals; and (d) adjusting to new roles. One essential finding that emerged across all themes was relatives' constant need for care, for support and for health professionals to \"be there.\" CONCLUSION: Relatives need support and care during the entire EVT pathway. They tend to be modest and ignore their own needs. Relatives who experience chaos, fear and worry need to be met by professionals with real presence. RELEVANCE TO CLINICAL PRACTICE: These findings will be used as a foundation for development of local structures and policies that should provide knowledge and ensure a consistent and proactive approach to meet the needs of the relatives in a timely and efficient manner.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Sørensen, Kristina Eiskjaer","Dreyer, Pia","Rasmussen, Mads","Simonsen, Claus Ziegler","Andersen, Grethe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-172883"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Acute admission","Anxiety","Endovascular therapy","Experience","Interviews","Nursing","Observation","Qualitative","Ricoeur","Stroke","Support"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"endovascular therapy after acute ischaemic stroke experiences and needs of relatives","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jocn.14664","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-172883","identifier":[{"id":"30184281","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85053494941","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-4c783489-eb4b-482a-b310-ebf102607891"],"keyword":["Ricoeur","acute admission","anxiety","endovascular therapy","experience","interviews","nursing","observation","qualitative","stroke","support"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-19B1D92109F6E8BC0CDF1DA9D0E26044"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jocn.14664","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/198039877/jocn.14664.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University (AU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina Eiskjaer","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Kristina Eiskjaer","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pia","key":"dreyerpau","last":"Dreyer","locid":"a30cdbd7-b134-4577-b1fc-0d4ebd98e698","name":"Dreyer, Pia","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"10307123-564d-4db1-872d-d0a91168ce4e","name":"Rasmussen, Mads","orcid":"0000-0002-0416-6767","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Claus Ziegler","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"ccf2fb52-6a4a-45b2-adb0-d6e83324879f","name":"Simonsen, Claus Ziegler","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Grethe","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"97e157c9-4cb4-4690-a971-06e4699b50fe","name":"Andersen, Grethe","orcid":"0000-0001-6807-2500","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30184281"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/jocn.14664","issn":["09621067","13652702"],"issn_org":["09621067"],"issue":"5-6","journal":"Journal of Clinical Nursing","pages":"792-800","publisher":"Wiley-Blackwell Publishing Ltd","status":"p","title":"Journal of Clinical Nursing","volume":"28"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85053494941"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-4c783489-eb4b-482a-b310-ebf102607891"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Endovascular therapy after acute ischaemic stroke-Experiences and needs of relatives","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-172883","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"En belgisk undersøgelse har kigget på køreegnethed hos ældre bilister med en klinisk diagnose. Endvidere foretages en sammenligning af vurderingen af køreegnethed udført af en lægefaglig specialist og af et tværfagligt team på et testcenter.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Krogh Andersen, Sandra Kristina","Møller, Mette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-330720"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"er der sammenhæng mellem den lægefaglige vurdering og vurdering baseret på testkørsel","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/203310779/Er_der_sammenh_ng_mellem_den_l_gefaglige_vurdering_og_vurdering_baseret_p_testk_rsel.PDF","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-330720","ids":["dtu-57f49608-a6ec-465b-9030-977698c10c46"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2AD37E83404231AA72F88861CE0D680E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.trafiksikkerhedsforskning.dtu.dk/arkiv/nr-47/moon-et-al","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/203310779/Er_der_sammenh_ng_mellem_den_l_gefaglige_vurdering_og_vurdering_baseret_p_testk_rsel.PDF","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics