{"abstract":"En amerikansk undersøgelse viser, at nedsættelse af hastighedsgrænsen har en positiv effekt på trafiksikkerheden i form af lavere hastighed og færre ulykker, hvis forskellen mellem den faktiske hastighedsgrænse og den \"foretrukne\" hastighedsgrænse ikke er for stor.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Krogh Andersen, Sandra Kristina","Møller, Mette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-355380"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"små hastighedsnedsættelser giver lavere hastighed og færre ulykker","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/185950925/Sm_hastighedsneds_ttelser_giver_lavere_hastighed_og_f_rre_ulykker.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-355380","ids":["dtu-aa1dad65-a95b-4376-9fb8-5c362f0eeb8e"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BCB355653FF017C80F7A808BFAD65A2F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/185950925/Sm_hastighedsneds_ttelser_giver_lavere_hastighed_og_f_rre_ulykker.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics, Transport","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Managem