{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Knudsen, Mette Præst","Andersen, Kristina Vaarst","Krabbe, Anders Dahl","Frederiksen, Marianne Harbo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-593283"],"event":{"end":"2018-12-19","place":"Tel Aviv, il","start":"2018-12-17","title":"AOM Specialized Conference","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how do start ups navigate in uncertain markets with regulatory constraints regulation and entrepreneurial strategies in the nascent drone industry","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-593283","ids":["sdu-45fa9c0d-bb75-47f6-8747-96be944298e1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-55DB5328D9B8B7B31C67CA30DA8B7E55"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM)","SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM), Centre for Integrative Innovation Management","SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, SAM-RES, Dean's Office - Faculty of Business and Social Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Præst","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"efc4aa3e-11bb-4546-b241-8ce6dd970891","name":"Knudsen, Mette Præst","orcid":"0000-0002-2055-5308","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina Vaarst","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"46d2bbb6-cde6-45b4-b04d-dcbcbad97c83","name":"Andersen, Kristina Vaarst","orcid":"0000-0002-0181-6832","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Dahl","key":"krabbepau","last":"Krabbe","locid":"325db1d4-dbad-4283-8772-7a610427e7da","name":"Krabbe, Anders Dahl","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marianne Harbo","key":"frederiksenpau","last":"Frederiksen","locid":"cfe310fc-a616-44d6-b340-91ceda7e4029","name":"Frederiksen, Marianne Harbo","orcid":"0000-0002-1518-7416","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-45fa9c0d-bb75-47f6-8747-96be944298e1"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"How do start-ups navigate in uncertain markets with regulatory constraints? : Regulation and entrepreneurial strategies in the nascent drone industry","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-593283","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Cerebral ischemia causes widespread capillary no-flow in animal studies. The extent of microvascular impairment in human stroke, however, is unclear. We examined how acute intra-voxel transit time characteristics and subsequent recanalization affect tissue outcome on follow-up MRI in a historic cohort of 126 acute ischemic stroke patients. Based on perfusion-weighted MRI data, we characterized voxel-wise transit times in terms of their mean transit time (MTT), standard deviation (capillary transit time heterogeneity - CTH), and the CTH:MTT ratio (relative transit time heterogeneity), which is expected to remain constant during changes in perfusion pressure in a microvasculature consisting of passive, compliant vessels. To aid data interpretation, we also developed a computational model that relates graded microvascular failure to changes in these parameters. In perfusion-diffusion mismatch tissue, prolonged mean transit time (>5 seconds) and very low cerebral blood flow (≤6 mL/100 mL/min) was associated with high risk of infarction, largely independent of recanalization status. In the remaining mismatch region, low relative transit time heterogeneity predicted subsequent infarction if recanalization was not achieved. Our model suggested that transit time homogenization represents capillary no-flow. Consistent with this notion, low relative transit time heterogeneity values were associated with lower cerebral blood volume. We speculate that low RTH may represent a novel biomarker of penumbral microvascular failure.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Engedal, Thorbjørn Søndergaard","Hjort, Niels","Hougaard, Kristina Dupont","Simonsen, Claus Ziegler","Andersen, Grethe","Mikkelsen, Irene Klærke","Boldsen, Jens Kjærgaard","Eskildsen, Simon Fristed","Hansen, Mikkel Bo","Angleys, Hugo","Jespersen, Sune Nørhøj","Pedraza, Salvador","Cho, Tae-Hee","Serena, Joaquín","Siemonsen, Susanne","Thomalla, Götz","Nighoghossian, Norbert","Fiehler, Jens","Mouridsen, Kim","Østergaard, Leif"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-225001"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France","Germany","Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Hospices Civils de Lyon","University Hospital Dr Josep Trueta","University Medical Center Hamburg-Eppendorf","University of Girona","University of Hamburg"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"transit time homogenization in ischemic stroke a novel biomarker of penumbral microvascular failure","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6259320/pdf/10.1177_0271678X17721666.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-225001","identifier":[{"id":"28758524","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85044378781","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC6259320","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-a7d1a2f7-532e-4aae-a185-3c9dbc0d88ee"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DC3FBD2A461CED5490BAA38F1238221A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6259320/pdf/10.1177_0271678X17721666.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Center of Functionally Integrative Neuroscience"],"nora_code":"D