{"abstract":"Formålet med denne del-undersøgelse er at afdække forældres opfattelse af deres børns daglige transport herunder deres holdning til en eventuel sænkelse af kørekortalderen for knallert 45 og lille motorcykel. I undersøgelsen er der fokus på sikkerhed og mobilitet.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Møller, Mette","Bonde, Nanna Skou","Krogh Andersen, Sandra Kristina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-305555"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kvalitativ undersøgelse af forældres holdning til knallertkørsel med fokus på sikkerhed og mobilitet delnotat v","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/164663186/Del_V_For_ldres_holdning_til_knallertk_rsel.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-305555","ids":["dtu-03427ca1-700d-45b0-a000-17dc58359a70"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-26F0E1D0C81A15D2097F2B3A2E7B3D3A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/164663186/Del_V_For_ldres_holdning_til_knallertk_rsel.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Technology and Innovation Management","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport DTU"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"bc2c2ce5-846a-48d8-8f1c-98639e8c7604","name":"Møller, Mette","orcid":"0000-0002-0012-8691","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nanna Skou","key":"bondepau","last":"Bonde","locid":"f3163949-cb40-41ce-ae66-9c54a00af84b","name":"Bonde, Nanna Skou","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sandra Kristina","key":"kroghandersenpau","last":"Krogh Andersen","locid":"b35dc181-b805-4bfd-8753-398a7f4021f4","name":"Krogh Andersen, Sandra Kristina","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"36","place":"Lyngby, Denmark","publisher":"Technical University of Denmark","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-03427ca1-700d-45b0-a000-17dc58359a70"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Kvalitativ undersøgelse af forældres holdning til knallertkørsel med fokus på sikkerhed og mobilitet: Delnotat V","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-305555","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"TNFα-, IL-23- and IL-17-targeting drugs are highly effective in the treatment of psoriasis. However, the precise molecular mechanism remains unknown. In psoriatic skin the presence of Langerhans cells (LC) is reduced, but the role of LC is poorly understood. The purpose of this study was to investigate the impact of TNFα and IL-23/IL-17 on the presence of LC in the skin during treatment. Therefore, psoriatic skin was investigated before and after 4 days of adalimumab or ustekinumab treatment. Furthermore, TNFα and IL-17A stimulation was investigated in an ex vivo model of epidermis and dermis from healthy normal skin kept in cultures at an air-liquid interphase for 4 days. In a gene array analysis we found that the two LC markers, CD1a and CD207, were among the most up- or downregulated genes in psoriatic skin after anti-TNFα therapy. Validation showed that both mRNA expression and protein level followed the same pattern and became significantly upregulated after 4 days of treatment. No changes were seen after ustekinumab treatment. In the ex vivo skin model, a decrease in the CD1a level was seen after TNFα stimulation and it was caused by LC migration from epidermis. No response in LC migration was seen after IL-17A stimulation. Taken together, we demonstrated that changes in the LC level in epidermis precede the histological and clinical changes during adalimumab treatment in psoriatic skin. Furthermore, TNFα plays a prominent role in orchestrating LC migration in the skin. This seems not to be the true for the IL-23/IL-17A pathway. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Raaby, Line","Rosada, Cecilia","Nielsen, Ane Langkilde-Lauesen","Lauridsen, Kristina Lystlund","Vinter, H.","Andersen, Pernille Ommen","Kjellerup, Rasmus Boye","Johansen, Claus","Iversen, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-163927"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"langerhans cell markers cd000000000001a and cd000000000207 are the most rapidly responding genes in lesional psoriatic skin following adalimumab treatment","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85018620624","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-163927","identifier":[{"id":"28109175","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85018620624","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-3ca0779c-039d-418b-a7ed-8b8a2e4bbf13"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-357FF7BB7968B4DAC3977DC96791CC00"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Dermatology and Venereology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital (AUH)"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"raabypau","last":"Raaby","locid":"47a1c989-3031-450d-8d06-995b987ef525","name":"Raaby, Line","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Cecilia","key":"rosadapau","last":"Rosada","locid":"87b9137e-bcce-4aff-84a8-c6fa94796a88","name":"Rosada, Cecilia","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ane","key":"langkildepau","last":"Langkilde","locid":"0617cbaf-1771-447c-8ffe-c3b0ad8ed0d8","name":"Nielsen, Ane Langkilde-Lauesen","name_org":"Langkilde, Ane","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kristina Lystlund","key":"lauridsenpau","last":"Lauridsen","locid":"8f422b25-045f-4f98-be11-9ce47094c03b","name":"Lauridsen, Kristina Lystlund","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"vinterpau","last":"Vinter","name":"Vinter, H.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille Ommen","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"58da0d0a-5fe3-4f73-a179-046c37fc0b70","name":"Andersen, Pernille Ommen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Boye","key":"kjelleruppau","last":"Kjellerup","locid":"a14381f5-fed2-475e-a185-67796621f7ad","name":"Kjellerup, Rasmus Boye","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"C","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"593a3337-e8ac-482a-ace2-f36521834d3c","name":"Johansen, Claus","name_org":"Johansen, C","orcid":"0000-0002-5665-5212","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"iversenpau","last":"Iversen","locid":"0ee9531c-28fa-41bc-8eb4-64d8ae7f0fb1","name":"Iversen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-1816-4508","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28109175"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/exd.13304","issn":["09066705","14791250"],"issn_org":["09066705"],"journal":"Experimental Dermatology","pages":"804-810","paperid":"26(9)","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Experimental Dermatology"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85018620624"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-3ca0779c-039d-418b-a7ed-8b8a2e4bbf13"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Langerhans cell markers CD1a and CD207 are the most rapidly responding genes in lesional psoriatic skin following adalimumab treatment","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-163927","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Background: A high prestroke physical activity (PA) level is associated with reduced stroke rate, stroke mortality, better functional outcome, and possible neuroprotective abilities. The aim of the present study was to examine the possible neuroprotective effect of prestroke PA on 24-h cerebral infarct growth in a cohort of acute ischemic stroke patients treated with intravenous tPA and randomized to remote ischemic perconditioning. Methods: In this predefined subanalysis, data from a randomized clinical trial investigating the effect of remote ischemic perconditioning (RIPerC) on AIS was used. Prestroke (7 days before admission) PA was quantified using the PA Scale for the Elderly (PASE) questionnaire at baseline. Infarct growth was evaluated using MRI (acute, 24-h, and 1-month). Results: PASE scores were obtained from 102 of 153 (67%) patients with a median (interquartile range) age of 66 (58-73) years. A high prestroke PA level correlated significantly with reduced acute infarct growth (24 h) in the linear regression model (4th quartile prestroke PA level compared with the 1st quartile), β 4th quartile = -0.82 (95% CI -1.54 to -0.10). However, the effect of prestroke PA was present mainly in patients randomized to RIPerC, β 4th quartile = -1.14 (95% CI -2.04 to -0.25). In patients randomized to RIPerC, prestroke PA was a predictor of final infarct size (1-month infarct volume), β 4th quartile = -1.78 (95% CI -3.15 to -0.41). Conclusion: In AIS patients treated with RIPerC, as add-on to intravenous thrombolysis, the level of PA the week before the stroke was associated with decreased 24-h infarct growth and final infarct size. These results are highly encouraging and stress the need for further exploration of the potentially protective effects of both PA and remote ischemic conditioning.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Blauenfeldt, Rolf Ankerlund","Hougaard, Kristina Dupont","Mouridsen, Kim","Andersen, Grethe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-191602"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high prestroke physical activity is associated with reduced infarct growth in acute ischemic stroke patients treated with intravenous tpa and randomized to remote ischemic perconditioning","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1159/000477359","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-191602","identifier":[{"id":"28554177","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85020234249","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-6d2e2873-eb75-46b5-99a3-7faee8dc6556"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FB3096F750B13F4B35C6BC5DA95C2374"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1159/000477359","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Neurology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rolf Ankerlund","key":"blauenfeldtpau","last":"Blauenfeldt","locid":"2cc4cfa1-de55-413c-b008-6b5d1c275888","name":"Blauenfeldt, Rolf Ankerlund","orcid":"0000-0002-4846-9516","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina D","key":"hougaardpau","last":"Hougaard","locid":"1ab97559-86f2-4e28-be39-2b4ac80b4b34","name":"Hougaard, Kristina Dupont","name_org":"Hougaard, Kristina D","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim","key":"mouridsenpau","last":"Mouridsen","locid":"76dc2d53-90f2-4e1d-8967-169cda1e1b90","name":"Mouridsen, Kim","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Grethe","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"97e157c9-4cb4-4690-a971-06e4699b50fe","name":"Andersen, Grethe","orcid":"0000-0001-6807-2500","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28554177"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1159/000477359","issn":["10159770","14219786"],"issn_org":["10159770"],"issue":"1-2","journal":"Cerebrovascular Diseases","pages":"88-95","publisher":"S. Karger AG","status":"p","title":"Cerebrovascular Diseases","volume":"44"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85020234249"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-6d2e2873-eb75-46b5-99a3-7faee8dc6556"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"High Prestroke Physical Activity Is Associated with Reduced Infarct Growth in Acute Ischemic Stroke Patients Treated with Intravenous tPA and Randomized to Remote Ischemic Perconditioning","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-191602","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To compare perinatal and pregnancy outcomes including adherence to the Institute of Medicine's (IOM) recommendations for gestational weight gain (GWG) in pregnant women with conception <18 months (early group) compared to ≥18 months following gastric bypass (late group). METHODS: Retrospective cohort study comprising 71 women with gastric bypass and a singleton pregnancy presenting at Odense University Hospital, November 2007-October 2013. Data were extracted from medical records and laboratory systems. The primary outcomes were timing of pregnancy and adherence to the IOM's recommendations for GWG. Secondary outcomes were birthweight, preterm delivery, cesarean section (CS), iron deficiency and post partum hemorrhage (PPH). RESULTS: Forty-three (61%) women conceived less than 18 months after gastric bypass surgery. Women in the late group had a significantly higher risk of requiring CS or receiving intravenous iron supplementation compared to the early group (57% versus 30%, p = 0.03 and 29% versus 7%, p = 0.02, respectively). Early conception was not significantly associated with insufficient GWG, preterm delivery or birthweight. Among 54 women with information on GWG, only 13 (24%) had an appropriate GWG. CONCLUSION: The majority of pregnant women with gastric bypass did not fulfill guidelines for GWG; however, this study could not support the recommendation to postpone pregnancy.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Stentebjerg, Louise Laage","Andersen, Lise Lotte Torvin","Renault, Kristina M","Støving, René Klinkby","Jensen, Dorte Møller"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-594145"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bariatric surgery","Gestational weight gain","Maternal outcome","Neonatal outcome","Pregnancy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pregnancy and perinatal outcomes according to surgery to conception interval and gestational weight gain in women with previous gastric bypass","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84978532597","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-594145","identifier":[{"id":"84978532597","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27426696","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-490c661a-07c2-4ff1-bdfb-df3d5b57f2ea"],"keyword":["Bariatric surgery","gestational weight gain","maternal outcome","neonatal outcome","pregnancy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7B0B985D30B297C14FB94C9512BBE342"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Gynaecology and Obstetrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise","key":"laagestentebjergpau","last":"Laage Stentebjerg","locid":"722c1818-2110-4736-82af-b4340f24a905","name":"Stentebjerg, Louise Laage","name_org":"Laage Stentebjerg, Louise","orcid":"0000-0003-1419-0223","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lise Lotte Torvin","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"d279b6e3-7642-448b-ba80-e0dedae472e7","name":"Andersen, Lise Lotte Torvin","orcid":"0000-0003-2997-2228","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"renaultpau","last":"Renault","locid":"71450333-81f3-4739-a961-71ee3f220084","name":"Renault, Kristina M","name_org":"Renault, Kristina","orcid":"0000-0002-6387-9652","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Klinkby","key":"støvingpau","last":"Støving","locid":"4aab81f6-352f-4c74-82a2-23589beb9fd5","name":"Støving, René Klinkby","orcid":"0000-0002-4255-5544","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorte Møller","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a221b393-70f9-4f53-902e-63d1a13f8f60","name":"Jensen, Dorte Møller","orcid":"0000-0002-3298-9824","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27426696"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/14767058.2016.1208746","issn":["14764954","14767058"],"issn_org":["14767058"],"issue":"10","journal":"Journal of Maternal - Fetal & Neonatal Medicine","pages":"1182-1188","publisher":"Informa Healthcare","status":"p","title":"Journal of Maternal - Fetal & Neonatal Medicine","title_org":"The Journal of Maternal-Fetal & Neonatal Medicine","volume":"30"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84978532597"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-490c661a-07c2-4ff1-bdfb-df3d5b57f2ea"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Pregnancy and perinatal outcomes according to surgery to conception interval and gestational weight gain in women with previous gastric bypass","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-594145","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"We studied the etiology of encephalitis in a fin whale (Balaenoptera physalus) that stranded in 2016 on the coast of Denmark. Dolphin morbillivirus (DMV) was detected in the brain and other organs. Phylogenetics showed close relation to DMV isolated from a striped dolphin (Stenella coeruleoalba) from Spain in 2012.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Jo, Wendy K.","Grilo, Miguel L.","Wohlsein, Peter","Andersen-Ranberg, Emilie Ulrikka","Hansen, Mette S.","Kinze, Carl C.","Hjulsager, Charlotte K.","Olsen, Morten T.","Lehnert, Kristina","Prenger-Berninghoff, Ellen","Siebert, Ursula","Osterhaus, Albert","Baumgaertner, Wolfgang","Jensen, Lasse F.","van der Vries, Erhard"],"cuid":["S03-098.60-025495"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["van der Vries, Erhard"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Justus Liebig University Giessen","University of Veterinary Medicine Hannover, Foundation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Fiskeri- og Søfartsmuseet"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dolphin morbillivirus in a fin whale balaenoptera physalus in denmark 000000002016","src":["au","dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85030980562","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-098.60-025495","identifier":[{"id":"85030980562","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000412579200030","type":"wos"},{"id":"28513327","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-b01d34ca-8c84-45a9-a75a-b9576e9d9574","dtu-083f4e86-e29a-44bc-adf6-2e672a065831","ku-be704999-0031-44a2-9d43-d8ca9016cb6d"],"lang":"English","level":"Sc