thern Denmark"],"title":"Immunoregulatory T Cells May Be Involved in Preserving CD4 T Cell Counts in HIV-Infected Long-Term Nonprogressors and Controllers","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-081.50-047268","year":"2014","yearsub":2014}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Disperse dyes are well-known contact sensitizers. However, they are not included in the majority of commercially available baseline patch test series. OBJECTIVES: To investigate the outcome of patch testing with a textile dye mix (TDM) consisting of eight disperse dyes at dermatology clinics in various countries. PATIENTS/MATERIALS/METHODS: Two thousand nine hundred and seven consecutive dermatitis patients at 12 dermatology clinics representing nine countries were tested with a TDM at 6.6%, consisting of Disperse Blue 35, Disperse Yellow 3, Disperse Orange 1 and 3, and Disperse Red 1 and 17, all at 1.0%, and Disperse Blue 106 and Disperse Blue 124, each at 0.3%, provisionally included in the baseline series. Eighty-seven per cent of the patients allergic to the TDM were also tested with the eight separate dyes. RESULTS: Contact allergy to TDM was found in 108 patients (3.7%). The frequency of contact allergy varied from 2.1% to 6.9% in different centres. Simultaneous reactivity to p-phenylenediamine was found in 57 of the TDM-positive patients (53%). The most frequent dye allergen among the TDM-positive patients was Disperse Orange 3. The contact allergy could have explained or contributed to the dermatitis in approximately one-third of the patients for whom clinical relevance of the TDM contact allergy was recorded. CONCLUSIONS: The TDM should be considered for inclusion in the European baseline series.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Ryberg, Kristina","Agner, Tove","Andersen, Klaus E","Bircher, Andreas","Diepgen, Thomas","Foti, Caterina","Giménez-Arnau, Ana","Gonçalo, Margarida","Goossens, An","Johansen, Jeanne D","Le Coz, Christophe","Maibach, Howard I","Bruze, Magnus"],"cuid":["S02-086.76-043741"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Aged 80 and over","Azo Compounds","Benzocaine","Child","Child Preschool","Contact allergy","Dermatitis Allergic Contact","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Patch Tests","Patch testing","Phenylenediamines","Textiles","Young Adult","p phenylenediamine","textile dye mix"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"patch testing with a textile dye mix a multicentre study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/cod.12244","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-086.76-043741","identifier":[{"id":"84908152859","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24815318","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-7c0996d3-d46f-4333-931d-fd777840b249","sdu-2eff1edf-2121-421a-9714-3aaa281d5832"],"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Azo Compounds","Benzocaine","Child","Child, Preschool","Dermatitis, Allergic Contact","Disperse Orange 3","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Patch Tests","Phenylenediamines","Textiles","Young Adult","contact allergy","disperse dyes","p -phenylenediamine","patch testing","simultaneous reactivity","textile dye mix"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-05040DF88A0DAE8BFAA5172821F42C12"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/cod.12244","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Dermatovenerology and allergy (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Kristina","key":"rybergpau","last":"Ryberg","name":"Ryberg, Kristina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Tove","key":"agnerpau","last":"Agner","locid":"fead5c49-b790-42e2-8793-e16de84b7bee","name":"Agner, Tove","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Klaus Ejner","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"867deb8a-d0f4-4503-b2a1-e3d34c98ef3f","name":"Andersen, Klaus Ejner","orcid":"0000-0002-6181-824X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andreas","key":"bircherpau","last":"Bircher","name":"Bircher, Andreas","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas","key":"diepgenpau","last":"Diepgen","name":"Diepgen, Thomas","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Caterina","key":"fotipau","last":"Foti","name":"Foti, Caterina","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ana","key":"giménezarnaupau","last":"Giménez-Arnau","name":"Giménez-Arnau, Ana","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Margarida","key":"gonçalopau","last":"Gonçalo","name":"Gonçalo, Margarida","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Margarida","key":"goncalopau","last":"Goncalo","name":"Goncalo, Margarida","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"An","key":"goossenspau","last":"Goossens","name":"Goossens, An","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jeanne D","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"2caf86f2-1ce0-4314-835d-46bcfcf4e337","name":"Johansen, Jeanne D","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christophe","key":"lecozpau","last":"Le Coz","name":"Le Coz, Christophe","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Howard I","key":"maibachpau","last":"Maibach","name":"Maibach, Howard I","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Magnus","key":"bruzepau","last":"Bruze","name":"Bruze, Magnus","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24815318"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/cod.12244","issn":["01051873","13966669"],"issn_org":["01051873"],"issue":"4","journal":"Contact Dermatitis","pages":"215-223","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"Contact Dermatitis","volume":"71"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84908152859"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-7c0996d3-d46f-4333-931d-fd777840b249","sdu-2eff1edf-2121-421a-9714-3aaa281d5832"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Patch testing with a textile dye mix – a multicentre study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.76-043741","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Experience, measured as seniority, is seldom sufficient to explain individual professionals’ abilities to contribute with valuable knowledge to team production. We need to pay attention to professionals’ knowledge and its fit to the project they engage in. In many industries and settings, the cognitive quality of knowledge held by individual professionals is the key microfoundation for project level performance. This paper empirically tests effects of project participants with and without knowledge diversity for project level performance for projects aiming for varying degrees of repetition and reconfiguration. The results indicate that project performance benefits form contributions from individuals holding diverse knowledge only when projects aim for high differentiation levels. This positive association is not just moderated, it may even be reversed in the case of professionals participating in low differentiation level projects aiming for repetition of already proven formulas.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Andersen, Kristina Vaarst"],"cuid":["S02-095.12-031676"],"event":{"end":"2014-08-05","place":"Philadelphia, us","start":"2014-08-01","title":"74th Annual Meeting of the Academy of Management","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Brokerage","Labor mobility","Microfoundations"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"repetition or reconfiguration project characteristics and mobile professionals performance","src":["cbs","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-095.12-031676","ids":["cbs-74d384ae-4fc7-4f51-a349-79efa26d19ff","sdu-8ce980b1-f1f9-4fe9-8aca-468ef3ed2ae7"],"keyword":["Broke