{"abstract":"One third of the pregnant Danish women are overweight or obese. Maternal obesity is an independent risk factor for adverse maternal and foetal outcomes including infertility, miscarriage, congenital malformations, preeclampsia, gestational diabetes, complicated deliveries, caesarean section, macrosomia and childhood obesity. This article reviews the effect of maternal obesity on obstetric and neonatal outcomes and provides recommendations for management of obesity in pregnancy.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Vinter, Christina Anne","Tanvig, Mette Honnens","Damm, Peter","Naver, Klara Vinsand","Andreasen, Kirsten Riis","Andersen, Lise Lotte Torvin","Liest, Sara","Lunde, Søren Rasmussen","Jensen, Dorte Møller","Renault, Kristina Martha"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-422840"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"obese pregnant women and complications in relation to pregnancy and birth","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/overvaegtige-gravide-og-komplikationer-i-relation-til-graviditet-og-foedsel","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-422840","identifier":[{"id":"84862004353","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-315ed47a-3ecb-4df4-9b87-ca00595a7112"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-7-0C6F21233626CD678FF36C5493818AA4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/overvaegtige-gravide-og-komplikationer-i-relation-til-graviditet-og-foedsel","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other hospitals","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-OTH","l3nl":"Other Hospitals","l3nn":"Other Hospitals","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Hospitals","namevar":["Gynækologi og Obstetrik"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"unclear universities","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-UND","l3nl":"Undetermined","l3nn":"Unclear Universities","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Unclear Universities","namevar":["Institut for Planlægning"],"nora_code":"DI-U-UND","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Christina Anne","key":"vinterpau","last":"Vinter","name":"Vinter, Christina Anne","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mette Honnens","key":"tanvigpau","last":"Tanvig","name":"Tanvig, Mette Honnens","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"dammpau","last":"Damm","locid":"884d03d5-5981-4d33-80c6-adb21f836deb","name":"Damm, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Klara Vinsand","key":"naverpau","last":"Naver","name":"Naver, Klara Vinsand","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kirsten Riis","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","name":"Andreasen, Kirsten Riis","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lise Lotte Torvin","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Lise Lotte Torvin","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sara","key":"liestpau","last":"Liest","name":"Liest, Sara","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Søren Rasmussen","key":"lundepau","last":"Lunde","name":"Lunde, Søren Rasmussen","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dorte Møller","key":"jen