{"abstract":"This unique book reveals the procedural aspects of knowledge-based urban planning, development and assessment. Concentrating on major knowledge city building processes, and providing state-of-the-art experiences and perspectives, this important compendium explores innovative models, approaches and lessons learnt from a number of key case studies across the world.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Andersen, Kristina Vaarst","Lorenzen, Mark","Laursen, Stine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-564186"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-RW"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-RW","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"creating the creative class based knowledge city models of denmark","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-564186","ids":["ruc-7a86b8de-340c-4aaa-ae13-dd7f1f4e10c3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C73492A629360A637FA34D96611A560D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"rockwool foundation","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-RW","l3nn":"Rockwool Foundation","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Rockwool Foundation","namevar":["Rockwool Fondens Forskningsenhed"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-RW","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Kristina Vaarst","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"25c0c224-78de-408c-a79c-001208cfa4bc","name":"Andersen, Kristina Vaarst","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mark","key":"lorenzenpau","last":"Lorenzen","name":"Lorenzen, Mark","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Stine","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, Stine","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tan","key":"yigitcanlarpedh","last":"Yigitcanlar","name":"Yigitcanlar, Tan","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kostas","key":"metaxiotispedh","last":"Metaxiotis","name":"Metaxiotis, Kostas","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Francisco J.","key":"carrillopedh","last":"Carrillo","name":"Carrillo, Francisco J.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9780857936035"],"pages":"24-39","place":"Cheltenham, UK","publisher":"Edward Elgar Publishing","status":"p","subtitle":"Policies, Plans and Metrics","title":"Building Prosperous Knowledge Cities"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84881855059"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Non-Profit Organisations","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-7a86b8de-340c-4aaa-ae13-dd7f1f4e10c3"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Creating : The Creative Class-based Knowledge City Models of Denmark","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-564186","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"For offshore wind turbines on deeper waters, a jacket sub-structure supported by axially loaded piles is thought to be the most suitable solution. The design method recommended by API and two CPT-based design methods are compared for two uniform sand profiles. The analysis show great difference in the predictions of bearing capacities calculated by means of the three methods for piles loaded in both tension and compression. This implies that further analysis of the bearing capacity of axially loaded piles in sand should be conducted.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Thomassen, Kristina","Andersen, Lars Vabbersgaard","Ibsen, Lars Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-096330"],"event":{"end":"2012-06-23","place":"Ixia, Rhodes, gr","start":"2012-06-17","title":"International Ocean and Polar Engineering Conference 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Capacity","Offshore","Piles","Sand"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of design methods for axially loaded driven piles in cohesionless soil","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?eid=2-s2.0-84866098393&partnerID=40&md5=10b90557d43156d1b92b9ce41087e4f5","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-096330","identifier":[{"id":"84866098393","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9fadf99f-a027-4edc-b2cc-ee064d91bcd5"],"keyword":["Capacity","Offshore","Piles","Sand"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-5DEE61926172D4844AE620C6EAC09C1C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?eid=2-s2.0-84866098393&partnerID=40&md5=10b90557d4315