{"abstract":"In the latest years the number of pregnant women having undergone bariatric surgery before pregnancy has increased rapidly. In pregnancy, they seem to have a reduced risk of obesity-related complications but an increased risk of mechanical complications causing small bowel obstruction and complications due to malabsorption. This article reviews the effect of bariatric surgery before pregnancy on obstetric and neonatal outcomes and provides, based on the limited available evidence, recommendations for the management of pregnancy in these women.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Renault, Kristina","Andersen, Lise Lotte Fischer","Kjær, Mette Karie Mandrup","Lauenborg, Jeannet","Anne Cathrine, Gjerris","Berlac, Janne Foss","Jensen, Dorte Møller","Damm, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-531423"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Studienævnet for Nordiske Studier og Sprogvidenska"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pregnancy following bariatric requires special attention","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/graviditet-efter-bariatrisk-kirurgi-kraever-speciel-opmaerksomhed","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-531423","ids":["ku-e70d3302-0499-4158-8d5b-0c7007925e35"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2BE5C2E51C0870BE647B13649F22B6D7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/graviditet-efter-bariatrisk-kirurgi-kraever-speciel-opmaerksomhed","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Studienævnet for Nordiske Studier og Sprogvidenska"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Kristina","key":"renaultpau","last":"Renault","name":"Renault, Kristina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lise Lotte Fischer","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Lise Lotte Fischer","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mette Karie Mandrup","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"f363b0ca-4a6d-48a9-951e-21b6183a6e28","name":"Kjær, Mette Karie Mandrup","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jeannet","key":"lauenborgpau","last":"Lauenborg","locid":"ebe072a4-8bdb-46da-80a7-72f9ceb007fc","name":"Lauenborg, Jeannet","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gjerris","key":"annecathrinepau","last":"Anne Cathrine","name":"Anne Cathrine, Gjerris","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Janne Foss","key":"berlacpau","last":"Berlac","name":"Berlac, Janne Foss","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Dorte Møller","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Dorte Møller","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"dammpau","last":"Damm","locid":"884d03d5-5981-4d33-80c6-adb21f836deb","name":"Damm, Peter","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"16","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"1076-1079","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","title_org":"Ugeskrift for Laeger","volume":"174"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous",