{"abstract":"Bogen gennemgår LP-modellens teoretiske grundlag og praktiske anvendelse på dagtilbudsområdet.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kristoffersen, Kristina Østergaard","Nielsen, Margit Margrethe","Nordahl, Thomas","Andersen, Pia Guttorm"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-650683"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Senter for Praksisrettet Utdanningsforskning, Høgskolen i Hedmark"],"keyword":["Dagtilbud","LP modellen","pædagogisk analyse"],"level":"sci","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lp modellen og børns læring og adfærd grundbog for det pædagogiske personale i daginstitutioner","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-650683","ids":["ucn-3d183f28-aeb9-4837-ad0f-ecd8d8ad42d1"],"keyword":["LP-modellen","dagtilbud","pædagogisk analyse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-3403DC0F0505403AD726DEFF304E9951"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN act2learn"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"senter for praksisrettet utdanningsforskning høgskolen i hedmark","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Senter for Praksisrettet Utdanningsforskning, Høgskolen i Hedmark","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina Østergaard","key":"kristoffersenpau","last":"Kristoffersen","locid":"fc564274-58d8-4d81-89b3-2395e54e03f0","name":"Kristoffersen, Kristina Østergaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Margit Margrethe","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"17b1fff7-1712-4711-8c68-a2d915403592","name":"Nielsen, Margit Margrethe","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"nordahlpau","last":"Nordahl","name":"Nordahl, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pia Guttorm","key":"andersenped","last":"Andersen","locid":"2de462ff-a43b-4462-b75a-9a3c7add2049","name":"Andersen, Pia Guttorm","rank":4,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"edition":"1. udgave","isbn":["9788799468201"],"pages":"120","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-3d183f28-aeb9-4837-ad0f-ecd8d8ad42d1"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"LP-modellen og børns læring og adfærd : Grundbog for det pædagogiske personale i daginstitutioner","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-650683","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"The translocation t(1;19)(q23;p13)/der(19)t(1;19) is a risk stratifying aberration in childhood B-cell precursor acute lymphoblastic leukaemia (BCP ALL) in the Nordic countries. We have identified 47 children/adolescents with t(1;19)/der(19)t(1;19)-positive BCP ALL treated on two successive Nordic Society of Paediatric Haematology and Oncology (NOPHO) protocols between 1992 and 2007 and have reviewed the clinical and cytogenetic characteristics of these cases, comprising 1·8% of all cases. The translocation was balanced in 15 cases (32%) and unbalanced in 29 cases (62%). The most common additional chromosome abnormalities were del(9p), i(9q), del(6q), and del(13q). The median age was 7years, the median white blood cell (WBC) count was 16×10 9/l, and the female/male ratio was 1·2. The predicted event-free survival (EFS) at 5 and 10years was 0·79, whereas the predicted overall survival (OS) at 5 and 10years was 0·85 and 0·82, respectively. Nine patients had a bone marrow relapse after a median of 23months; no patient had a central nervous system relapse. Additional cytogenetic abnormalities, age, gender, WBC count or whether the t(1;19) was balanced or unbalanced did not influence EFS or OS. Compared to cases with t(12,21) and high hyperdiploidy, EFS was similar, but overall survival was worse in patients with t(1;19)/der(19)t(1;19) (P=0·004).","author_count":15,"contributors":["Andersen, Mette K.","Autio, Kirsi","Barbany, Gisela","Borgström, Georg","Cavelier, Lucia","Golovleva, Irina","Heim, Sverre","Heinonen, Kristina","Hovland, Randi","Johannsson, Johann H.","Johansson, Bertil","Kjeldsen, Eigil","Nordgren, Ann","Palmqvist, Lars","Forestier, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-668020"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Andersen, Mette K."],"country":["Finland","Iceland","Norway","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Karolinska Institutet","Landspitali University Hospital","Lund University","Umeå University","University of Bergen","University of Eastern Finland","University of Gothenburg","University of Helsinki","University of Oslo","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Acute lymphoblastic leukaemia","Paediatric"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"paediatric b cell precursor acute lymphoblastic leukaemia with t 000000000001 000000000019 q000000000023 p000000000013 clinical and cytogenetic characteristics of 000000000047 cases from the nordic countries treated according to nopho protocols","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/80053564189","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-668020","identifier":[{"id":"21902680","type":"pmid"},{"id":"80053564189","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-37f4a1fb-1642-42ad-ba61-9bf68f230534"],"keyword":["Acute lymphoblastic leukaemia","PBX1","Paediatric","T(1;19)","TCF3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-ADE6B7E099E899DFB6BE16E2F07FC9F8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, Department for Clinical Genetics","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics - Bioinformatics Research Centre (BiRC), Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fi","key":"university 